+map state and revision. Replay complete records when opening; truncate an incomplete tail, report
+interior corruption, and preserve confirmed writes. A failed write/sync requires rollback; if rollback
+fails, stop accepting writes until recovery. This is the persistence supplied by the reference
+[KV implementation and experiments](../docs/contracts/kv.md). It leaves the map/CAS/watch model above intact.
 
